  {
    "screen": "steam-millennium-config-backup-allowlist-config-and-style-snapshot-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "日常请 AI 运行 tools/Invoke-MillenniumBackup.ps1 -Mode Status -Json 或看驾驶舱，就能知道现有周任务和最近一份快照；若要手动留一份，用 -Mode Snapshot，恢复先看 RestorePlan。开始菜单里的“备份状态”入口已在 9 月 26 日撤下，原来的状态窗口脚本仍可直接运行。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **只取支持文件**　从真实安装中找核心配置和自己的样式，按白名单复制。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
